{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO SINGULARITY DINAMICS!</strong> <br>Discover what happened to the 70s Tech Lab <strong>Singularity Dynamics</strong>, where scientists try to push the bounds of science. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/7c8224c70b1868a45c69cfdd742adefa.poster.avif?t=1758212824\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/7c8224c70b1868a45c69cfdd742adefa.webm?t=1758212824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCIENCE MEETS STORYTELLING:</strong> <br><br><strong>AXION 1986</strong> is more than a game. it\u2019s a retro-futuristic cinematic journey where players learn real science concept\u00a0 while exploring a mystery about <strong>ambition</strong>, <strong>responsibility</strong>, and <strong>discovery</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/60cee2b538e13305214df4f7e954a746.poster.avif?t=1758212824\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/60cee2b538e13305214df4f7e954a746.webm?t=1758212824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A MIND BENDING STORY:</strong> <br>Step into the role of Emily, a young journalist who travels to a remote island to uncover the fate of her brothers,  <br>The game blends retro-futuristic exploration, puzzle solving, and a strong narrative arc.  <br>It\u2019s not a horror game or a walking simulator, but rather a puzzle thriller adventure with moments of humour and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/59b63d6abd1523e3599f420e7400ff72.poster.avif?t=1758212824\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/59b63d6abd1523e3599f420e7400ff72.webm?t=1758212824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSIC BASED PUZZLE:</strong> <br>Puzzles are grounded in real scientific concepts:<strong> mass</strong>, <strong>light</strong>, <strong>sound</strong>,\u00a0<strong>relativity</strong>, <strong>gravity</strong> and even <strong>manipulation of time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/be3bf459bd44a64fc43c79441af4a534.poster.avif?t=1758212824\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/be3bf459bd44a64fc43c79441af4a534.webm?t=1758212824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE DESIGN:</strong> <br>Wood Panels with Analog tech, cathode screens, and research facilities Inspired by the Tech corporations of the 70s and 80s like IBM, XEROX, APPLE .This colourful aesthetic clashes with the abandoned and deserted structures.<br><br><strong>What happened to the island? where are all the scientists?</strong> Unravel the secrets of AXION 1986 and ultimately confront ethical choices about the consequences of pushing scientific boundaries.<strong> </strong><br> <br> <br><strong> </strong><br> <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034530?t=1758212824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/1d070b4c74b1f077f5d91bcd8f367f8fec9482c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758212824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/8072f19dc9a74d9ba7f35186776579f8af796519/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758212824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/8072f19dc9a74d9ba7f35186776579f8af796519/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758212824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO SINGULARITY DINAMICS!</strong> <br>Discover what happened to the 70s Tech Lab <strong>Singularity Dynamics</strong>, where scientists try to push the bounds of science. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/7c8224c70b1868a45c69cfdd742adefa.poster.avif?t=1758212824\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/7c8224c70b1868a45c69cfdd742adefa.webm?t=1758212824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cl