g>,\u00a0<strong>relativity</strong>, <strong>gravity</strong> and even <strong>manipulation of time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/be3bf459bd44a64fc43c79441af4a534.poster.avif?t=1758212824\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/extras/be3bf459bd44a64fc43c79441af4a534.webm?t=1758212824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE DESIGN:</strong> <br>Wood Panels with Analog tech, cathode screens, and research facilities Inspired by the Tech corporations of the 70s and 80s like IBM, XEROX, APPLE .This colourful aesthetic clashes with the abandoned and deserted structures.<br><br><strong>What happened to the island? where are all the scientists?</strong> Unravel the secrets of AXION 1986 and ultimately confront ethical choices about the consequences of pushing scientific boundaries.<strong> </strong><br> <br> <br><strong> </strong><br> <br> </p>","developers":["Spicy Muffin Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034530/a80faaa03e334efa2e451f9f8b7a0154ae6bfe25/header.jpg?t=1758212824","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034530/882761516/17bd46779688cf5f3314a2ce8433dd6b028943d3/1757876421/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758212823","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034530/882761516/17bd46779688cf5f3314a2ce8433dd6b028943d3/1757876421/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758212823","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4034530/882761516/17bd46779688cf5f3314a2ce8433dd6b028943